      <iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal">
        <translations>
          <translation xml:lang="en" type="subtitle">
            <text for="L1">- Synced by music</text>
            <text for="L2">So funny.</text>
            <text for="L3">You are ready to sell yourself for the truth.</text>
            <text for="L4">True, this is too stupid and, probably, annoying.</text>
            <text for="L5">How to look for a needle in the hayloft -</text>
            <text for="L6">- there are few chances.</text>
            <text for="L7">So funny.</text>
            <text for="L8">You are ready to sell yourself for the truth.</text>
            <text for="L9">True, this is too stupid and, probably, annoying.</text>
            <text for="L10">How to look for a needle in the hayloft -</text>
            <text for="L11">- there are few chances.</text>
            <text for="L12">Everyone is thinking about how to entertain themselves.</text>
            <text for="L13">They realize late that they don’t have enough time.</text>
            <text for="L14">I wish I could join the flow,</text>
            <text for="L15">the eyes search for insight.</text>
            <text for="L16">I warned, but they didn’t blindly believe me.</text>
            <text for="L17">Glances at the ceiling</text>
            <text for="L18">my forehead was completely wet.</text>
            <text for="L19">If only someone could help find ways and solutions.</text>
            <text for="L20">The race is over</text>
            <text for="L21">there's no need to run.</text>
            <text for="L22">They realize it only at the end.</text>
            <text for="L23">When the finish line is behind you,</text>
            <text for="L24">your body will be scraped out of the way.</text>
            <text for="L25">So funny.</text>
            <text for="L26">You are ready to sell yourself for the truth.</text>
            <text for="L27">True, this is too stupid and, probably, annoying.</text>
            <text for="L28">How to look for a needle in the hayloft -</text>
            <text for="L29">- there are few chances.</text>
            <text for="L30">So funny.</text>
            <text for="L31">You are ready to sell yourself for the truth.</text>
            <text for="L32">True, this is too stupid and, probably, annoying.</text>
            <text for="L33">How to look for a needle in the hayloft -</text>
            <text for="L34">- there are few chances.</text>
          </translation>
        </translations>
